Changes in XFree86-3.3.3-10d:
 Geert's accel patch from 1210 (we already had the xkb part)
 Xpmac can now take -noaccel

Only XFree86-3.3.3-Xpmac and FBDev have had any changes since 10b or 10c,
so you can be safe and just snag either of these, which should show up on
linuxppc.org soon.

